{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Super Words",
    "steam_appid": 2434620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Words</strong> is a puzzle crossword game with innovative new mechanics. Place the given words on the board and connect them according to the provided clues. It's a fantastic game for refreshing your mind and relaxing. You'll find yourself immersed in solving puzzles, connecting letters and words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find 25,000 different puzzles in each of the 8 supported languages, totaling 200,000 puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 10 different board sizes, ranging from 7x7 to 16x16, catering to players with various preferences. Whether you're seeking relaxation or a challenge, there's something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, there are two main types of clues to assist you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Corner Clues:</strong> Displayed as squares, indicating the first or last letter of a word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2795\u00a0<strong>Crossing Clues:</strong> Displayed as plus shapes, indicating that two words intersect at that letter, placed horizontally and vertically. This letter could be the first, last, or middle letter of those words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level is completed when you connect all the words to the starting golden word on the board, turning them all golden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this relaxing journey, a nearly endless adventure in word puzzle-solving.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Words</strong> is a puzzle crossword game with innovative new mechanics. Place the given words on the board and connect them according to the provided clues. It's a fantastic game for refreshing your mind and relaxing. You'll find yourself immersed in solving puzzles, connecting letters and words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find 25,000 different puzzles in each of the 8 supported languages, totaling 200,000 puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 10 different board sizes, ranging from 7x7 to 16x16, catering to players with various preferences. Whether you're seeking relaxation or a challenge, there's something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, there are two main types of clues to assist you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Corner Clues:</strong> Displayed as squares, indicating the first or last letter of a word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2795\u00a0<strong>Crossing Clues:</strong> Displayed as plus shapes, indicating that two words intersect at that letter, placed horizontally and vertically. This letter could be the first, last, or middle letter of those words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level is completed when you connect all the words to the starting golden word on the board, turning them all golden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this relaxing journey, a nearly endless adventure in word puzzle-solving.</p>",
    "short_description": "Super Words is a relaxing and innovative crossword puzzle game. Place and connect words on the board based on the given clues. Perfect for refreshing your mind and forgetting everything else.",
